cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use agent-guard in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "agent-guard: guardrails for AI coding agents"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Amit
    family-names: Kumar
    alias: growthperclick
    website: "https://iamamitkumar.dev"
repository-code: "https://github.com/RavenRepo/agent-guard"
url: "https://ravenrepo.github.io/agent-guard/"
abstract: >-
  agent-guard refuses the shortcuts AI coding agents take at edit time,
  such as skipped tests, silenced type checks, placeholder code and masked
  exit codes, gates success claims on a passing run of the matching check,
  scans branch diffs in CI, and accepts guarded builds only when their
  behaviour is proven in a sandbox.
keywords:
  - AI coding agents
  - guardrails
  - Claude Code hooks
  - Codex hooks
  - reward hacking
  - code quality
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-11-26"
